,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.971265218,"data":"18:38:42   fc0a6a4efb1d2bfa boy neutral | Hot soup, inside a dumpling... in a skin you can almost see through. H\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.972333178,"data":"18:38:42   175971ff0663f3c4 boy neutral | Welcome to The Dumpling Boy! Stick around, and my uncle will show you\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.973229626,"data":"18:38:42   0dc2161283c760a1 uncle neutral | I'm fine.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.974212158,"data":"18:38:42   f7efd0965048c87d boy neutral | The Silk Road? Never one road, you know. Loads of them, by land and se\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.975187113,"data":"18:38:42   9ae042009ba2f552 boy neutral | Near Shanghai there was a port, Qinglong. Over a thousand years ago, i\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.976108606,"data":"18:38:42   08c131e7e19ad6e6 boy neutral | Dad's first page just says: Shanghai. Be patient. The soup is the secr\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.977066698,"data":"18:38:42   e6e97fb18ef8307c uncle neutral | Mm... dumplings...\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.978166134,"data":"18:38:42   3c0f60ebe6f0ce3a boy neutral | This is Nanxiang, an old canal town. These days, it's part of Shanghai\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.979095949,"data":"18:38:42   b11f83a2d82ef87a boy neutral | Two little brick pagodas, about a thousand years old.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.980132656,"data":"18:38:42   428ad7f87c9467cb uncle neutral | A thousand?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.981052013,"data":"18:38:42   fe451674d799013d boy neutral | The temple burned in 1766. They're still standing.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.982014624,"data":"18:38:42   7060f1563c85fea2 uncle neutral | Things that last. I like that.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.98301167,"data":"18:38:42   1d22f55f55493315 boy neutral | Hello! Um, how do you get soup inside?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.983906642,"data":"18:38:42   2d54b246aa498486 grandma neutral | Everyone asks. You don't pour it in. You make it a jelly first.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.984899555,"data":"18:38:42   f52900408645c1e6 grandma neutral | Pork skin, boiled for hours. Cold, it sets. Then I chop it, fold it in\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.985845001,"data":"18:38:42   f8095ed6551a7793 boy neutral | Huh.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.986802231,"data":"18:38:42   98166281d4fb9d2b uncle neutral | Then the steam melts it back into soup. That's why you never boil them\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.987868278,"data":"18:38:42   cc23c718b101b3ad boy neutral | Wait, really? The soup goes in solid?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.988878365,"data":"18:38:42   165024b71c14afc1 boy neutral | How many folds?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.989981586,"data":"18:38:42   a84b630238e31095 grandma neutral | Fourteen, sixteen, eighteen. Every cook has a number. Mine's eighteen.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.991094961,"data":"18:38:42   e36c3c6fce81d7d7 uncle neutral | ...six, seven... oh, hang on.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.992165207,"data":"18:38:42   872952d7e2feb5a1 grandma neutral | Start again, dear.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.993425342,"data":"18:38:42   145a48775bc5ba7f grandma neutral | Slowly, slowly!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.994662155,"data":"18:38:42   35834c004f792557 boy neutral | Uncle, wait. There's soup inside!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.995870653,"data":"18:38:42   092e872bd690d9c4 uncle neutral | Relax. For dumpling research!\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.997084207,"data":"18:38:42   2968bcbd72232911 uncle neutral | ...There was soup inside.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":89.998122555,"data":"18:38:42   68a7605d04699eb6 grandma neutral | Mm-hm. Everyone learns once.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.000256201,"data":"18:38:42   fb12778e1af31de5 boy neutral | Breathe, Uncle.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.000648567,"data":"18:38:42   366c810bcba8b1f7 grandma neutral | Okay, watch. Lift it by the top knot, like this. Then onto a spoon.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.001750714,"data":"18:38:42   295fef823f07451c grandma neutral | A tiny hole, to let the steam out.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.002895208,"data":"18:38:42   55607935df5df086 boy neutral | Then we wait?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.004053275,"data":"18:38:42   4adeeffe064df9c2 grandma neutral | Good. Soup first.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.005157429,"data":"18:38:42   d1bc3c143135d5e4 boy neutral | Better?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.006307668,"data":"18:38:42   7837e620dcf33380 uncle neutral | Oh... that's good. For dumpling research.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.00743932,"data":"18:38:42   3edea794e2e1a94b grandma neutral | Now the dumpling, with a little black vinegar and ginger.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.008581882,"data":"18:38:42   e052a9f102bef0e6 boy neutral | So who made the very first one?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.009691155,"data":"18:38:42   38c721ae4c943d2d narrator neutral | Legend says: around the year 1871, a shop in Nanxiang sold one very bi\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.010909859,"data":"18:38:42   fc04c41ace58d37c narrator neutral | He made it smaller. And inside, he hid soup, set as jelly.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.012119773,"data":"18:38:42   05293ebe00424155 narrator neutral | It became famous by getting smaller.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.013973895,"data":"18:38:42   86137cc97dc36b9a boy neutral | That's not what he looked like.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.014324119,"data":"18:38:42   1afa92d1f061c4b1 uncle neutral | He had my energy.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.015476621,"data":"18:38:42   d77a16209cc1b840 boy neutral | Many towns claim this dumpling. So: legend says.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.016629738,"data":"18:38:42   8d92038709deb28b grandma neutral | That hat... A man sat on that stool, years ago. He burned his tongue,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.017820376,"data":"18:38:42   20eac48ff8555b36 boy neutral | My... dad?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.018960072,"data":"18:38:42   cc1e33d297e866a4 boy neutral | Dad wrote... rush it, you get burned. Be patient, you get the best par\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.020067069,"data":"18:38:42   1d191fac263bd20b uncle neutral | Your dad picked a good first page.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.021160441,"data":"18:38:42   abc4a747e6fb29a9 boy neutral | ...Yeah.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.022273394,"data":"18:38:42   a5cac3b75b3db066 grandma neutral | Then he went south. To Guangzhou.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.023431828,"data":"18:38:42   7146d41cda6232b2 uncle neutral | More dumplings?\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":90.024531821,"data":"18:38:42   034b8c85a93d3ec5 boy neutral | Dad was right... the best part is worth the wait.\n"}
